 "summary": "A series of thirty-seven 500 mW surface-mount zener diodes in the flat-lead SOD-123F package, with nominal zener voltages from 2.4 V to 75 V held to ±2 %. Each type is specified for its zener voltage window and dynamic impedance at a test current IZT, dynamic impedance at a lower current IZK, and reverse leakage at a stated reverse voltage. BZT52B10 RHG is the 10 V type (9.80 V to 10.20 V at 5 mA, marking 10VB) on a 7-inch reel in halogen-free compound.",
